  "editorial": {
    "name": "aidenybai/cnfast",
    "descriptionZh": "tailwind-merge + clsx 的替换品：58 个真实仓库跑下来快 25 倍且输出逐字节相同，README 顶部注明项目已不再维护。",
    "takeawayZh": "一条命令把项目里的 cn 换成更快的实现，API 不变",
    "noteZh": "README 开头是 Note 块，直言作者已转去做 shadcn 的 cn 包、cnfast will no longer be maintained in favor of cn。正文写它在 58 real-world repositories 上比 tailwind-merge + clsx 快 25×，输出 byte-identical，API 相同、无需改代码，示例是 cn(\"px-2 py-1\", isActive && \"px-4\", {\"text-red-500\": hasError})。安装是 npm install cnfast，还提供 npx cnfast migrate 一键迁移与 npx shadcn@latest add aidenybai/cnfast/cn 写进 registry。About 栏 License 标 MIT，topics 是 clsx / cn / tailwindcss，Languages 为 TypeScript 98.8%。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
